stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: 任务创建
    pending --> running: Runner 开工
    running --> awaiting_review: 完工待审(complete --route needs_review)
    running --> completed: 纯文档/无代码任务直达终点
    awaiting_review --> approved_to_ship: 创始人批准
    awaiting_review --> completed: 新增窄边·此前完成已写 route + 合并凭证 + 授权闸放行
    approved_to_ship --> completed: 发布成功(session_completed)
    approved_to_ship --> blocked: 发布失败(route=blocked)
    completed --> [*]: 触发收尾清理
